coaching-app/
├── app.py                     (Core Server Engine & Routing)
├── requirements.txt           (Packages)
├── Procfile                   (Render Deploy)
├── database/
│   ├── tests.json             (CBT Test Series Data)
│   ├── courses.json           (Courses & Coupons Data)
│   ├── config.json            (Live Stream & App Settings)
│   └── users.json             (Student Accounts & Login Data)
└── templates/
    ├── index.html             (Main App Shell - sabhi parts ko jodta hai)
    ├── login.html             (Student Login & Register Screen)
    ├── admin.html             (Admin Dashboard Framework)
    ├── test.html              (Online CBT Exam Window)
    ├── components/            (Student UI ke chhote tukde)
    │   ├── header.html        (Top Bar & Student Profile Greeting)
    │   ├── banner.html        (Top Poster & Contact Helpline)
    │   ├── live_class.html    (Protected YouTube Live Player)
    │   ├── grid_buttons.html  (12 App Buttons Grid)
    │   ├── courses_modal.html (8 Courses List & Coupons)
    │   ├── bottom_nav.html    (Bottom 4 Icons Navigation)
    │   └── info_modal.html    (Notes, E-Books, Timetable Popups)
    └── admin_modules/         (Admin Panel ke alag-alag control boxes)
        ├── live_control.html  (Admin se Live class badalna)
        ├── course_control.html(Admin se Coupon & Price badalna)
        ├── test_creator.html  (Admin se Naya Test banana)
        └── q_creator.html     (Admin se Questions add karna)
